{%- comment -%}
  SYNOR Diaries — niche ni filter patti.

  Blog na articles na tags par thi jate bane chhe, pan FAKT e char shreni ni
  je store ma live vaparaay chhe:

    gender-*    (3)  Him · Her · Anyone
    occasion-*  (6)  Daily · Office · Date · Party · Wedding · Gym
    family-*    (4)  Fresh & Aquatic · Floral & Fruity · Woody & Oud · Amber & Sweet
    brand-*          Inspired house

  season-, mood-, scent- tags products par chhe, ane e par collections pan
  chhe — pan store ni navigation e rite sort nathi karti. Etle blog ma pan
  nathi: vaanchak ne e j shabdo dekhaay je menu ma pan chhe.

  Bot na internal tags (yt-, pick-, series-) ane kind tags (blog, vlog,
  review, letter) ahiya nathi — kind upar ni patti ma chhe.

  Namespace kaadhi nakhyu chhe: `occasion-office` → "office". Prefix e bot
  ni bhasha chhe, customer ni nahi.

  `sort_label` aave to e jamni kor bese — chhapa ni patti ma kram no
  ullekh evi j jagya e hoy. E button nathi: Shopify no blog sada sauthi
  navo pehlo aape chhe ane Liquid ma kram badalvano rasto nathi, etle
  khota control mukava karta saachu lakhvu saru.

  Vaapar: {% render 'sa-blog-taxbar', blog: blog, current_tags: current_tags,
             sort_label: s.word_latest %}
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- capture pills -%}
  {%- for t in blog.all_tags -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign low = t | downcase
      assign k6 = low | slice: 0, 6
      assign k7 = low | slice: 0, 7
      assign k9 = low | slice: 0, 9

      assign keep = false
      if k7 == 'family-' or k9 == 'occasion-' or k6 == 'gender' or k6 == 'brand-'
        assign keep = true
      endif

      assign lbl = low | remove_first: 'occasion-' | remove_first: 'family-'
      assign lbl = lbl | remove_first: 'gender-' | remove_first: 'brand-' | replace: '-', ' '
    -%}
    {%- if keep -%}
      {%- if current_tags contains t -%}
        <a class="on" href="{{ blog.url }}">{{ lbl }}</a>
      {%- else -%}
        <a href="{{ blog.url }}/tagged/{{ t | handleize }}">{{ lbl }}</a>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- assign pills_t = pills | strip -%}
{%- if pills_t != blank or sort_label != blank -%}
  <nav class="np-tax" aria-label="Topics">
    {%- if pills_t != blank -%}
      {%- unless current_tags and current_tags.size > 0 -%}
        <a class="on" href="{{ blog.url }}">{{ all_label | default: 'All' }}</a>
      {%- else -%}
        <a href="{{ blog.url }}">{{ all_label | default: 'All' }}</a>
      {%- endunless -%}
      {{ pills }}
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if sort_label != blank -%}<span class="so">{{ sort_label }}</span>{%- endif -%}
  </nav>
{%- endif -%}
